OL,3,GNEWSASeal rescued after becoming wedged
OL,4,Abetween rocks                          
OL,6,FA young grey seal had to be rescued    
OL,7,Fafter it became wedged between rocks.  
OL,9,FThe British Divers Marine Life Rescue  
OL,10,F(BDMLR) said it "joined forces" with   
OL,11,Fthe Seal Project and the coxswain of   
OL,12,FBrixham RNLI to reach and rescue the   
OL,13,Fseal in Brixham, Devon, on Saturday.   
OL,15,FSarah Greenslade, a marine mammal medic
OL,16,Fat BDMLR and founder of the Seal       
OL,17,FProject - a charity which monitors and 
OL,18,Fprotects Grey and Common seals in south
OL,19,FDevon, said she got a call from a      
OL,20,Fmember of the public.                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
