OL,3,GNEWSASeal rescued after becoming wedged
OL,4,Abetween rocks                          
OL,6,FShe said there was no easy way for the 
OL,7,Fseal to get out as it was "well and    
OL,8,Ftruly stuck", but the rescue operation 
OL,9,Fwas a success.                         
